        "description": {
            "value": "<p><strong>Trigger</strong> You are targeted by a spell.</p>\n<p><strong>Requirements</strong> You are trained in the skill associated with the tradition of the triggering spell (Arcana for arcane, Nature for primal, Occultism for occult, and Religion for divine).</p><hr /><p>You quickly sketch a rune in the air to gain a modicum of protection against the triggering magic. You gain a +1 circumstance bonus to your saving throw and AC against the spell.</p>"
